OL,3,CProgramme listings for THU 4 DEC
OL,4,G2200FThe Essay: Electronic Women
OL,5,     GHannah Peel delves into the
OL,6,     Gstories and sound worlds of five
OL,7,     Gfemale electronic pioneers.
OL,8,     GTonight, the "diva of the diode"
OL,9,     GSuzanne Ciani.
OL,10,G2215FNight Tracks
OL,11,     GSara Mohr-Pietsch presents an
OL,12,     Gadventurous, immersive soundtrack
OL,13,     Gfor late-night listening, from
OL,14,     Gclassical to contemporary and
OL,15,     Geverything in between.
OL,16,G2330F'Round Midnight
OL,17,     GRounding off his week, Venna
OL,18,     Gchooses to spotlight a release by
OL,19,     Ga saxophonist and producer that
OL,20,     Ghe has long been influenced by.
